..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : EDI2VKAUV.RAHMENPOS
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      :
.. Funktion       : Suche Rahmenposition zu einer Rahmennummer + Artikelnummer
.. Functionality  : Find blanket order row to blanket order number + product number
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
..  args to find blanket order row
..   text   xideksart       number of product
..   text   xideksrah       number of banket order
..
..  result fields
.type P3:1   xrahkopf        ? _F|defined(U|xrahkopf)
.type P3:2   xrahpos         ? _F|defined(U|xrahpos)
..
..  internal use
.type text   xtselRAH        ? _F|defined(U|xtselRAH)
.type text   xtartex         ? _F|defined(U|xtartex)
..
..
.. already fetched this blanket order row?
.continue START  ?  F|empty(U|xrahpos) ; F|empty(U|xrahkopf) ; F|empty(U|xideksart) ; F|empty(U|xideksrah)
.. get compareable product identifier
.formula U|xtartex = ""
.formula U|xtartex = U|xrahpos^artex^nummer  ?  F|isvalue('U|xideksart', "N2")
.formula T|xtartex = U|xrahpos^artex^such    ?  F|isvalue('U|xideksart', "SW2")
.. skipp to end if xrahkopf and xrahpos do match, blanket order number and product in xrahpos match data in edi message
.continue END  ?  U|xrahkopf^id=U|xrahpos^kopf^id  &  U|xrahkopf^nummer=U|xideksrah  &  U|xtartex=U|xideksart
..
..
!START: initialize return values
.formula U|xrahkopf = ""
.formula U|xrahpos = ""
..
..
..  missing required parameters
.continue END  ?  F|empty(U|xideksart) ; F|empty(U|xideksrah)
..
..
..  query blanket order with its number
..  query for row with blanket order + product number
..  blanket order row must be active! "status=`" (empty)
..
.formula U|xtselRAH = "$,,;@gruppe=1;ktyp=(BlanketOrder);@ablage=(1);nummer==" + U|xideksrah
.assign U|xrahkopf =  'U|xtselRAH'
.continue END     ? _G|mehr
..
.formula U|xtselRAH = "$,,;@gruppe=2;kotyp=(BlanketOrder);@ablageart=(3)"
.formula U|xtselRAH = U|xtselRAH + ";kopf="  + U|xrahkopf^id
.formula U|xtselRAH = U|xtselRAH + ";artex=" + U|xideksart
.formula U|xtselRAH = U|xtselRAH + ";kunde=" + U|xrahkopf^kunde^id
.formula U|xtselRAH = U|xtselRAH + ";status=`"
.assign U|xrahpos = 'U|xtselRAH'
.continue END     ? _G|mehr
..
..
..  return values
..
..   P3:1   xrahkopf        blanket order
..   P3:2   xrahpos         blanket order row
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
